@baseUrl = http://localhost:5203
@token = REEMPLAZAR_CON_JWT
@userId = a8c931c5-3b39-4a5e-80d7-67942972b748

### Usuario autenticado. Aunque el controlador no muestra [Authorize], enviar JWT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-user
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Listado del tenant. Requiere el rol TenantAdmin en el JWT.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/get-tenant-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear usuario del tenant. Roles permitidos: TenantAdmin, TenantUser,
### Manager, Operator, Inv*, Cxc*, Cxp*, Fac* y Cnt*.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/add-users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "firstName": "María",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "email": "maria@empresa.com",
  "userName": "maria.ventas",
  "password": "ClaveSegura1!",
  "roles": ["FacUser"]
}

### Cambiar mi contraseña. Requiere la contraseña actual.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/change-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "ClaveAnterior1!",
  "newPassword": "ClaveNueva2!"
}

### Reiniciar contraseña de usuario del mismo tenant. Requiere TenantAdmin.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/users/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "newPassword": "Temporal3!"
}
